   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Superlative with am",
     "texto": [
      "To say \"the most\" without a noun after it, use **am** + adjective + **-(e)sten**: **Der Zug fährt am schnellsten** (the train goes fastest). With **gut**: **am besten**. The ending can include an **e** to make pronunciation easier: **am größten**, **am teuersten**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Superlative before a noun",
     "texto": [
      "Before a noun, the superlative takes the adjective ending according to the article, gender, number and case: **der schnellste Zug**, **die schönste Stadt**, **das beste Hotel**. In this position **am** isn't used."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
